        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Lord of Gears wraps hit grappling hook around the target, grabbing them (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.kWc1fhmv9LBiTuei]{Grabbed}) and pulling a flying target to it, or a target on the ground up to 20 feet closer. On a critical hit, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained}.</p><p>If Grappling Hook is immediately followed by Hydraulic Punch, only increase multi-attack penalty once, after the Hydraulic Punch. Hydraulic Punch releases the grab if it hits, as it pushes the target away.</p><p>The Lord of Gears can move while it has a target grabbed this way. If the target is adjacent to it, the target is dragged along with it.</p>"
        },
