        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Lord of Gears can siphon energy from one of the pillars, sending out a massive arc of electricity. This targets all characters that The Lord of Gears can see (tremorsense is still enough to target). All targets make a @Check[type:reflex|dc:37|basic:true] or take @Damage[15d6[electricity]] damage.</p><p>Using this temporarily deactivates the aura of steam around the pillar and the pillars boiling and shocking burst attacks for 1 round. While deactivated, the pillar loses its hardness.</p>"
        },
