        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Boiling steam erupts from The Lord of Gears in a @Template[type:burst|distance:20] from any corner around the middle of its token. Creatures starting their turn in the area or moving into the area need to make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:37|basic:true] save or take @Damage[10d8[fire]] damage. Everything in the area also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} while the steam is present. The steam persists for 2 rounds, and this ability can be used once every [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><p>The Lord of Gears is immune to damage from Vent Steam.</p>"
        },
