        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>There are stone walls around each pillar, blocking them from being directly attacked. These walls are 10 feet tall, and are placed 5 feet away from the Pillars. Each wall is crit immune, has hardness 14, AC 10, and 50 hp. </p>"
