          "version": 0.941
        },
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>There are platforms built into the floors around the workshop that The Lord of Gears can control. At the end of its turn, The Lord of Gears can move any 3x3 (15 foot by 15 foot) section of floor up to 30 feet in any horizontal direction, pulling creatures standing on it along with it. This doesn't leave a hole in the floor.</p><p>As this is forced movement, it doesn't trigger reactions. It shifts the floor throughout the workshop, and so can move terrain through other creatures, but cannot move through the pillars.</p>"
        },
